## User

The sum of the decimal digits of a non-negative integer.

## Type

type
```haskell
sumDigits :: Int -> Int
```

## Term

```haskell
sumDigits n = sumDigits' n 0
```

## ghc

```haskell
sumDigits' :: Int -> Int -> Int
```

## ghc

```haskell
sumDigits' 0 acc = acc
sumDigits' n acc = sumDigits' (n-1) (acc + n)
```

